      "tier": 1,
      "reason": "tier 1: kills mutant gas_arrangement.rs:355 (candidate-beats-best margin +1e-6 flipped to -1e-6) in fit; extra_clearance_m [0.0, 1.0] repeats the base candidate, so two candidates tie on tonnage and the first one must keep the win (Python takes a later candidate only if it is better by more than 1e-6); no sweep case has a tie (issue #17 mutation run)",
